From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:58:29 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 073/147] hjviewer: words left from upstream, and the PC list's
 name
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

U14: the session menu's 'Insert Lock' reads '원격 화면 잠그기' (en
'Lock remote screen'), 'Insert Ctrl + Alt + Del' 'Ctrl+Alt+Del
보내기'. 'TCP tunneling' is '포트 포워딩' (en 'Port forwarding') and its
setting '포트 포워딩 허용', the name the rest of the app uses. The CM
request card says '이 PC에 연결을 요청하는 중…' (en 'Asking to connect
to this PC…'), and an incoming request is refused with [거부]
('Dismiss') as the voice call request is, not [취소].

U17: the account's PC list is '내 PC' (en 'My PCs') everywhere: the
tab, the notices after a login, logging out, the card menu's '내 PC에서
빼기' and its toasts, the Settings row, the empty hint, the update
screen's W line and the changed-key warning. The selected pill shows
its name beside the icon on a phone and in a desktop window of 720 px
or more; a phone's bar counts the name's width in its 40 px plan. The
tab without a login tells what a login brings. The server's bind
texts (hjv-api) follow in the server lane.

U18: the empty recent and favourite lists say what to do in plain
words instead of upstream's jokes about peers, and the About page of
a pinned build drops upstream's slogan.

U19: the texts about a remote PC call it '그 PC' (en 'that PC'), not
'이 PC', which is the device the app runs on: the wake question (now
'PC가 꺼져 있습니다. 켤까요?' with [취소]), the peer update card and
its link button, and ctl.rs's refusal and key warning.

U21: the desktop home calls this computer '이 PC' (en 'This PC'),
says '다른 기기에서 이 ID와 비밀번호로 이 PC에 연결할 수 있습니다.',
and the connection box is '원격 PC에 연결' (en 'Connect to a remote
PC'). 'Restart remote device' is '원격 PC 다시 시작', and the logout
texts that quote it follow.

U24: an account build no longer shows upstream's group banner with
the raw request error. The list that did not come says '내 PC 목록을
불러오지 못했습니다. 잠시 뒤 다시 시도해 주세요.' with [다시 시도],
and nothing while the server banner shows; the error itself still
goes to the debug log. The login options' error leads with the app's
networkFailed text; ko.rs's network_error_tip says [다시 시도].

U30: one button name, '다시 시도' (ko.rs Retry, HjvTexts.retry, and
the texts that point at it, with ctl.rs's test), and one sentence,
'다시 시도해 주세요.', for the gate's E2, E3 and E5, the account and
wake requests and the update screens; ko.rs's 'Please try later' and
'Please try 1 minute later' read the same way.

U48: no English left on Korean screens: the CM's 'Audio Input', the
session's 'Stop voice call' for 'End call', the phone's '버전: …',
'소스 코드(GNU AGPL-3.0)' on both About pages, the install page's
licence line and '라이선스', '터미널(베타)' and '터미널(관리자 권한,
베타)', and the security group's '이중 인증' (enter-2fa-title).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
